1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,406
Exam tip.

2
00:00:01,406 --> 00:00:04,609
Antibiotics act only on bacteria.

3
00:00:04,609 --> 00:00:11,888
A vaccine gives artificial active immunity; a ready made antiserum gives artificial passive immunity.

4
00:00:11,888 --> 00:00:17,747
And names matter: Salmonella Typhi, Apis cerana, Eisenia fetida.

